                f'<tg-emoji emoji-id="4983696199908328775">🔄</tg-emoji> Multiplier ×1.92\n'
                f'<tg-emoji emoji-id="6053003027793578665">🪙</tg-emoji> Balance: <b>{format_balance_in_currency(_rpa_balance, user_currency)}</b>\n\n'
                f"Tap ✊ ✌️ or ✋ on your keyboard 👇",
